{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46129","headline":"送郑阁赴闽辟 · 贯休","name":"送郑阁赴闽辟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"便便书腹德无邻，健笔从知又入闽。\n鹦鹉才须归紫禁，真珠履不称清贫。\n武夷山夹仙霞薄，螺女潭通海树春。\n从此应多好消息，莫忘江上一闲人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}